# Patterns (.NET regex, one per line) that must not appear in public artefacts of
# this repository. Private repository names are allowed; paths into them are not.
# A placeholder such as `clarity-framework/[private path withheld]` is allowed.
clarity-framework/(?!\[)[A-Za-z0-9_.-]
echelon-organization-administration/(?!\[)[A-Za-z0-9_.-]
/tmp/claude-[0-9]+/
